b4 $6 { Wasting time on the queenside. This is inconsistent with 18...f5 and this imprecision allows White to consolidate. } ( { It was not too late for } 22... Rf4 23. c3 Rcf8 24. f3 g5 $5 { as above. } ) 
23. axb4 ( 23. b3 $5 R4c6 24. axb4 Qxb4 25. Ra1 $14 { also deserves attention. } ) 
