41. Qa7 Re1+ 42. Kg2 ( { Or } 42. Kh2 Qe4 $1 { and Black wins after either } 43. Kg2 Re2 { or } 43. Qf2 Re2 { . } ) 
Qe4 $1 { Threatening ...Re2 winning the rook on f3. } 43. g4 Re2+ 44. Kg3 Qe5+ 45. Kh4 ( 45. Rf4 Re3 { and wins. } ) 
Kh6 $1 { White resigned because of the threat of ...g7-g5#. } 
